  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div data-testid=\"video-page-container\" id=\"bbc-main\"><div><div data-testid=\"video-page-video-section\"><div><p>Eurovision 2026 has come to a close, with Bulgaria crowned winner and Israel in second place after a nail-biting public vote. </p><p>The UK finished last after receiving no points in the public vote, and history was made by Ukraine's entry for holding the contest's longest ever note.</p><p>Read more <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c8d87v9v660o\">here</a>.</p></div><p><time datetime=\"2026-05-17T02:00:44.709Z\">13 hours ago</time></p></div><div data-testid=\"tagsAndSocialStyled\"><div><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world/europe\" data-testid=\"internal-link\">Europe</a></p></div><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/topics/cg20vmmp95jt\" data-testid=\"internal-link\">Eurovision Song Contest</a></p></div><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/topics/crr7mlg0g83t\" data-testid=\"internal-link\">Bulgaria</a></p></div></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"texas-section-outer\" data-analytics-group=\"true\" data-analytics_group_type=\"texas-20\" data-analytics_group_position=\"2\" data-analytics_group_item_count=\"20\"><div data-testid=\"texas-grid\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cd6pnle9zngo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260506-094152-fab693f842-web-3.4.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/ba5b/live/4dae4880-4fad-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/ba5b/live/4dae4880-4fad-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/ba5b/live/4dae4880-4fad-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/ba5b/live/4dae4880-4fad-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/ba5b/live/4dae4880-4fad-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/ba5b/live/4dae4880-4fad-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/ba5b/live/4dae4880-4fad-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/ba5b/live/4dae4880-4fad-11f1-89a3-d1f559421220.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Rescuers wearing bright orange at the site of a damanged residential building in Kyiv\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Watch: BBC at Kyiv block of flats hit by Russian drone strike</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Russia launched one of the biggest air strikes on Kyiv since the start of the war with several apartment blocks hit.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Europe</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cx219p72x3xo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260506-094152-fab693f842-web-3.4.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/c922/live/2d2698d0-4ed9-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/c922/live/2d2698d0-4ed9-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/c922/live/2d2698d0-4ed9-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/c922/live/2d2698d0-4ed9-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/c922/live/2d2698d0-4ed9-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/c922/live/2d2698d0-4ed9-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/c922/live/2d2698d0-4ed9-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/c922/live/2d2698d0-4ed9-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Split image, Daniela Relph on the left and Kate Middleton on the right\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Why is the Princess of Wales in Italy this week?</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The Princess of Wales received an enthusiastic welcome from Italian crowds, on her return to overseas visits following her treatment for cancer.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Europe</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/ckgp541p5ndo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260506-094152-fab693f842-web-3.4.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/6d0b/live/c9366980-4b96-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/6d0b/live/c9366980-4b96-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/6d0b/live/c9366980-4b96-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/6d0b/live/c9366980-4b96-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/6d0b/live/c9366980-4b96-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/6d0b/live/c9366980-4b96-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/6d0b/live/c9366980-4b96-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/6d0b/live/c9366980-4b96-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Decorated soldiers watch the parade in Red Square\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Rosenberg: Scaled-back Victory Parade in Moscow's Red Square</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The BBC's Russia editor reports from Moscow, where the annual Victory Day display was quieter than usual.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Europe</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cx218zp9897o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260506-094152-fab693f842-web-3.4.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/d849/live/350d88e0-4a4e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/d849/live/350d88e0-4a4e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/d849/live/350d88e0-4a4e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/d849/live/350d88e0-4a4e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/d849/live/350d88e0-4a4e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/d849/live/350d88e0-4a4e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/d849/live/350d88e0-4a4e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/d849/live/350d88e0-4a4e-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Guy Hedgecoe on the left and MV Hondius on the right\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">How operation to disembark passengers on virus-hit cruise will work</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The BBC's Guy Hedgecoe reports from Tenerife, where some locals fear the ship's arrival could bring health risks.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Europe</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c4g8pexx029o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260506-094152-fab693f842-web-3.4.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/340e/live/97db3510-4a0a-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/340e/live/97db3510-4a0a-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/340e/live/97db3510-4a0a-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/340e/live/97db3510-4a0a-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/340e/live/97db3510-4a0a-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/340e/live/97db3510-4a0a-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/340e/live/97db3510-4a0a-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/340e/live/97db3510-4a0a-11f1-ac78-2112837ce2aa.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Split-screen showing woman on the left and man on the right being interviewed on the streets of Tenerife\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Tenerife resident calls docking of hantavirus ship 'reckless'</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">People on Tenerife in the Canary Islands have told the BBC they are concerned about the arrival of MV Hondius.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Europe</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cpqpjw1zdvjo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260506-094152-fab693f842-web-3.4.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/1ba9/live/21274a60-434a-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/1ba9/live/21274a60-434a-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1ba9/live/21274a60-434a-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/1ba9/live/21274a60-434a-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/1ba9/live/21274a60-434a-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/1ba9/live/21274a60-434a-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/1ba9/live/21274a60-434a-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1ba9/live/21274a60-434a-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Robot seen carrying elderly woman in Ukraine\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Watch: Elderly woman rescued by robot from Ukraine's frontline</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The Ukrainian army spotted the woman using a drone and sent the machine to her rescue as she was trying to leave her war-torn village.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">Europe</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c98mr589g8do\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260506-094152-fab693f842-web-3.4.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/075d/live/9ab469c0-3914-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/075d/live/9ab469c0-3914-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/075d/live/9ab469c0-3914-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/075d/live/9ab469c0-3914-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/075d/live/9ab469c0-3914-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/075d/live/9ab469c0-3914-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/075d/live/9ab469c0-3914-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/075d/live/9ab469c0-3914-11f1-8606-05fe34b06e1b.jpg.we